          <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:SEA_Games_2019_opening_at_the_Philippine_Arena_-_parade_PH_(Bocaue,_Bulacan;_11-30-2019).jpg" rel="noreferrer">Patrick Roque / Wikimedia Commons</a> ·
          <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:NLEX_Distance_Sign_-_Philippine_Arena_2,_Bocaue_4,_Tambubong_5.png" rel="noreferrer">PengualaHeadphones / Wikimedia Commons</a>.
          Ang arena photos ay CC BY-SA 4.0; ang NLEX sign graphic ay CC0. Naka-local copy ang lahat ng images sa site.
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

